  "body": "SchemaCrawler  release at last commit 154b3b0ea7d14ac1d541da4926378397489c9073\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump org.graalvm.polyglot:polyglot from 25.3.4.1 to 25.4.4.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2510\n* Bump org.graalvm.polyglot:js from 25.3.4.1 to 25.4.4.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2512\n* Bump org.graalvm.polyglot:python from 25.3.4.1 to 25.4.4.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2513\n* Bump org.apache.calcite.avatica:avatica-core from 1.28.0 to 1.29.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2514\n* Add routines for H2. Do not show unknown datatype lengths by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2516\n* Handle null values more concisely by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2517\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 4.38.1 to 4.38.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2519\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.6.36 to 1.6.37 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2518\n* v17.15.7 by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2520\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v17.15.6...v17.15.7",
